      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Contract\nInput: `{ config, session, chatId, text, meta }` (config: wahaBaseUrl, typingCharsPerSecond, typingMinSeconds, typingMaxSeconds, typingJitterSeconds, seenDelaySeconds).\nOutput: `{ sent: true, meta }` or `{ sent: false, error, meta }`; `meta` is echoed unchanged.\nPresence calls are best-effort; the send is never retried. A failure returns sent:false so the orchestrator fails the execution once, which triggers the error workflow.",
